e two minutes to read the questions printed in", "x0": 0.11978021978021978, "y0": 0.3605283605283605, "x1": 0.8791208791208791, "y1": 0.37373737373737376}, {"text": "this paper.", "x0": 0.11978021978021978, "y0": 0.3776223776223776, "x1": 0.2021978021978022, "y1": 0.39083139083139085}, {"text": "As you are listening to the recording, follow the questions. You may write notes if you wish", "x0": 0.11978021978021978, "y0": 0.411033411033411, "x1": 0.8791208791208791, "y1": 0.42424242424242425}, {"text": "in the Candidate\u2019s Notes spaces provided on pages 2\u20144. Anything you write in the Candidate\u2019s", "x0": 0.11978021978021978, "y0": 0.42735042735042733, "x1": 0.8791208791208791, "y1": 0.4405594405594406}, {"text": "Notes spaces will NOT be marked. You may make notes or write your answers at any time as", "x0": 0.11978021978021978, "y0": 0.44366744366744365, "x1": 0.8791208791208791, "y1": 0.4568764568764569}, {"text": "you are listening to the recording.", "x0": 0.11978021978021978, "y0": 0.46076146076146074, "x1": 0.3923076923076923, "y1": 0.473970473970474}, {"text": "You will hear the recording and then the questions will be read aloud. You will hear the", "x0": 0.11978021978021978, "y0": 0.49417249417249415, "x1": 0.8791208791208791, "y1": 0.5073815073815073}, {"text": "recording a SECOND time and then you will be given time to complete the answers.", "x0": 0.11868131868131868, "y0": 0.5104895104895105, "x1": 0.8065934065934066, "y1": 0.5236985236985237}, {"text": "You now have two minutes to read the questions.", "x0": 0.11978021978021978, "y0": 0.5439005439005439, "x1": 0.5197802197802198, "y1": 0.5571095571095571}, {"text": "Question 1 (3 marks)", "x0": 0.11978021978021978, "y0": 0.5944055944055944, "x1": 0.2945054945054945, "y1": 0.6068376068376068}, {"text": "Explain the ways Katrina Blowers conveys her feelings about her screen time.", "x0": 0.11978021978021978, "y0": 0.627039627039627, "x1": 0.7527472527472527, "y1": 0.6402486402486403}, {"text"